Key SQL Queries & Analytical Findings
1. High-Level Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
Total Revenue: Aggregated overall earnings generated across all valid transactions.  
PY

Total Order Volume: Evaluated total transactional record count.  
PY

Net Unit Sales: Summed item quantities while explicitly filtering out churned orders (WHERE OrderStatus != 'Cancelled' AND OrderStatus != 'Returned').  
PY

Cancellation Rate: Computed real-time order cancellation percentage using conditional aggregation:  
PY

SQL
SELECT 
    (SUM(CASE WHEN OrderStatus = 'Cancelled' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 1.0 / COUNT(*)) * 100 AS cancellation_rate
FROM sales;
2. Revenue & Product Performance
Top 6 Revenue Generating Products: Identified key product revenue drivers using categorical grouping and sorting:  
PY

SQL
SELECT 
    Product, 
    SUM(TotalPrice) AS revenue
FROM sales
GROUP BY Product
ORDER BY revenue DESC 
LIMIT 6;
Referral Channel Breakdown: Ranked acquisition efficiency by aggregating total revenue per ReferralSource.  
PY

3. Customer Behavior & Fulfillment Insights
Payment & Order Status Distribution: Evaluated quantity volume across payment choices and fulfillment statuses (PaymentMethod, OrderStatus).  
PY

Promotional Conversion: Tracked discount code adoption by filtering non-null coupon redemptions (WHERE CouponCode IS NOT NULL AND CouponCode != '').  
PY

Basket Size Analysis: Measured cart utilization efficiency by calculating the average items per order:  
PY

SQL
SELECT 
    SUM(Quantity) AS total_quantity,
    SUM(ItemsInCart) AS total_orders,
    (SUM(Quantity) * 1.0 / SUM(ItemsInCart)) AS avg_items_per_order
FROM sales;
